<title>BAHRAIN: Bahrain Commercial lifts 1996 net profit.</title>
<headline>Bahrain Commercial lifts 1996 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		 (million Bahraini dinars)</p>
<p> Net profit	    1.10    vs     0.61</p>
<p> Operating income    4.14    vs     3.46</p>
<p> Expenses		2.91    vs     2.89</p>
<p> Dividend		0.76    vs     0.48</p>
<p>Full Name: Bahrain Commercial Facilities Company.</p>
<p>Note - Traded on the Bahrain Stock Exchange, the company is specialised in providing loans to individuals and firms.</p>
</text>
